# Bench mode driven by the RP: a dummy job run to its result, then stop.
# EmuMD's line test cannot pass (no ROM3 data), so the debug bench skips it.
@debug
@bench commands
say "^WARN  Line test skipped" 500
say "^PASS  The device takes commands" 500
request 1 1 2
say "^Bench: test 1" 500
say "^  test=dummy" 1000
say "^  seconds=2" 100
log "ST\|   seconds=2" 100
say "^Bench: done" 100
request 3
say "^Bench mode: stopped by the RP" 500
log "ROM3 is test data again" 500
